Most calls pass `FIT_SUBFIELD_INDEX_MAIN_FIELD` (0xFFFF). The fast path returns `GetOffset()` for that value without calling `GetNumSubFields()`.

This cannot change results: the subfield count is at most 255 (a `FIT_UINT8`), so 0xFFFF always took the `GetOffset()` branch anyway.

```cpp
FIT_FLOAT64 FieldBase::GetOffset(const FIT_UINT16 subFieldIndex) const
{
    if (subFieldIndex == 0xFFFF)
        return GetOffset();

    if (subFieldIndex >= GetNumSubFields())
        return GetOffset();

    auto subfield = GetSubField(subFieldIndex);
    return NULL != subfield ? subfield->offset : 0.0;
}
```